  <section class="belowfold belowfold--rule go-faq-section" aria-labelledby="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="belowfold__inner belowfold__inner--narrow">
      <h2 class="belowfold__title" id="d2-faq-{{ section.id }}">Everything you need to know before trying Dandy.</h2>
      <p class="go-faq-intro">Real answers about what to expect, how it feels, and how to get the most out of your first gummy.</p>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>What does Dandy feel like?</summary><p>Most people describe Dandy as a clean, warm wave of upbeat focus and calm social energy. It feels like your best, clearest morning - alert, conversational, and motivated without the racing pulse, jitters, or sudden afternoon crash that comes with caffeine or energy drinks. You stay sharp, level-headed, and in complete control throughout your day.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How much should I take to start?</summary><p>If you are new to kratom, start with half a gummy (17.5 mg of mitragynine) and give it about 45 minutes. That is the ideal introductory amount to experience the smooth daytime focus. Once you know how your body responds, you can enjoy a full 35 mg gummy whenever you want deeper focus or an easy evening unwind.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How quickly does it work, and how long does it last?</summary><p>Because Dandy uses a fast-absorbing pectin gummy base, you will typically begin to notice the effects within 30 to 45 minutes (faster on an empty or light stomach). The smooth, upbeat energy and clear focus typically last between 3 to 5 hours, tapering off gently without any sudden dip or post-caffeine fatigue.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What ingredients are in Dandy, and is it third-party tested?</summary><p>Every Dandy gummy is made with clean, transparent ingredients: pure Mitragyna speciosa leaf extract standardized to an exact 35 mg of mitragynine, organic tapioca syrup, organic cane sugar, pectin (100% plant-based and vegan, zero gelatin), natural mixed berry flavoring, and natural colors from carrot and blueberry. Each gummy contains just 20 calories.</p><p>Purity is non-negotiable for us: every single batch is independently third-party lab tested for alkaloid potency, heavy metals, and microbials. You will find the exact batch number stamped on the back of your pouch, allowing you to review the <a href="{{ url_coa }}">Certificate of Analysis</a> anytime.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is Dandy legal, and how does it differ from 7-OH products?</summary><p>Yes, Dandy is 100% federally legal. Dandy is crafted exclusively from natural, unadulterated kratom leaf extract (<em>Mitragyna speciosa</em>), the traditional Southeast Asian botanical that has been enjoyed safely for generations.</p><p>Dandy is fundamentally different from synthetic or hyper-concentrated 7-hydroxymitragynine (7-OH) products, which have faced federal bans and regulatory crackdowns. Dandy contains only the natural alkaloid profile derived from whole leaf extract, is fully compliant with state and federal regulations, and ships directly to your doorstep.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is kratom habit-forming? Can I take it every day?</summary><p>Like coffee, tea, or any botanical that elevates your energy and focus, kratom can be habit-forming if used continuously without breaks. That is why we encourage intentional use. Dandy is best used as a dedicated tool for when you need it most - a high-focus work block, a creative session, an afternoon reset, or a relaxed social night. Taking regular days off keeps your natural tolerance low, so half a gummy or one gummy always delivers the exact feeling you love.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Who is Dandy designed for (and who should avoid it)?</summary><p>Dandy is formulated for healthy adults 21 and older looking for a cleaner alternative to excessive caffeine, synthetic energy boosters, or evening alcohol. As a standard safety precaution with any active botanical supplement, Dandy is not intended for individuals under 21, women who are pregnant or nursing, or anyone currently taking prescription medications without first consulting their healthcare provider.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if Dandy isn&#x27;t right for me?</summary><p>You can try Dandy with 100% peace of mind. We stand behind every pouch with our 30-Day Happiness Guarantee. If you take Dandy and don&#x27;t love the clean energy, focused clarity, or overall experience, simply send a quick note to <a href="mailto:support@foreverdandy.com">support@foreverdandy.com</a> within 30 days of receiving your order. We will refund your purchase immediately - no interrogation, no hurdles, and no hard feelings. You risk nothing by trying it.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
